eiten</div></div><div class="o-pricing-grid__column__price"><div class="promo-pill u-hide-on-mobile"></div><div class="plan-price"><div class="plan-rate v--free"><span class="plan-free-price">0 <span class="plan-currency">USD</span></span></div><div class="plan-term"><span class="term-copy">für immer kostenlos</span></div></div><div class="o-pricing-grid__column__button u-hide-on-mobile"><a href="https://slack.com/intl/de-de/get-started?p=free&amp;entry_point=pricing_page&amp;geocode=de-de#/create" data-gtm-click="SignUp" class="c-button v--secondary" data-clog-click data-clog-event="GROWTH_PRICING" data-clog-ui-component="pricing_page_grid" data-clog-ui-element="create_team" data-js-offer="free" data-qa="create_ws">Jetzt starten</a></div><div class="o-pricing-grid__column__button u-hide-on-desktop u-hide-on-tablet"><a href="https://slack.com/intl/de-de/get-started?p=free&amp;entry_point=pricing_page&amp;creation_path=free#/createnew" data-gtm-click="SignUp" class="c-button u-display--inline-block v--secondary" data-clog-click data-clog-event="GROWTH_PRICING" data-clog-ui-component="pricing_page_grid" data-clog-ui-element="create_team" data-js-offer="free" data-qa="create_ws">Jetzt starten</a></div></div></div><div class="o-pricing-grid__column__content"><div class="o-pricing-grid__column__features"><div data-row-id="1" class="o-pricing-grid__column__features__item height-1"><div class="o-pricing-grid__column__features__item-check"><svg class="u-display--block " width="20" height="20" fill="#730394" viewBox="0 0 17 17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true"><title></title><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m14.3838 3.3276c.3164.26739.3561.7406.0887 1.05695l-7.77602 9.20005c-.15078.1783-.37607.2763-.60937.2649s-.44798-.1308-.58067-.323l-3.024-4.38099c-.2353-.34089-.1497-.80799.19119-1.04329.34088-.2353.80798-.14971 1.04328.19118l2.46696 3.5739 7.14303-8.45104c.2674-.31635.7406-.35604 1.0569-.08866z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></div><span class="o-prici