								Der Schutz der Daten unserer Kund:innen sowie der Privatsphäre ihrer Benutzer:innen ist uns enorm wichtig. Slack stärkt und standardisiert nicht nur den Datenschutz in allen EU-Mitgliedsstaaten, sondern hält auch die DSGVO ein.
</span></div></span></div></td><td><svg class="u-display--inline-block" width="20" height="20" fill="#730394" viewBox="0 0 17 17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><title>Enthalten</title><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m14.3838 3.3276c.3164.26739.3561.7406.0887 1.05695l-7.77602 9.20005c-.15078.1783-.37607.2763-.60937.2649s-.44798-.1308-.58067-.323l-3.024-4.38099c-.2353-.34089-.1497-.80799.19119-1.04329.34088-.2353.80798-.14971 1.04328.19118l2.46696 3.5739 7.14303-8.45104c.2674-.31635.7406-.35604 1.0569-.08866z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></td><td><svg class="u-display--inline-block" width="20" height="20" fill="#730394" viewBox="0 0 17 17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><title>Enthalten</title><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m14.3838 3.3276c.3164.26739.3561.7406.0887 1.05695l-7.77602 9.20005c-.15078.1783-.37607.2763-.60937.2649s-.44798-.1308-.58067-.323l-3.024-4.38099c-.2353-.34089-.1497-.80799.19119-1.04329.34088-.2353.80798-.14971 1.04328.19118l2.46696 3.5739 7.14303-8.45104c.2674-.31635.7406-.35604 1.0569-.08866z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></td><td><svg class="u-display--inline-block" width="20" height="20" fill="#730394" viewBox="0 0 17 17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><title>Enthalten</title><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m14.3838 3.3276c.3164.26739.3561.7406.0887 1.05695l-7.77602 9.20005c-.15078.1783-.37607.2763-.60937.2649s-.44798-.1308-.58067-.323l-3.024-4.38099c-.2353-.34089-.1497-.80799.19119-1.04329.34088-.2353.80798-.14971 1.04328.19118l2.46696 3.5739 7.14303-8.45104c.2674-.31635.7406-.35604 1.0569-.08866z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></td><td><svg class="u-display--inline-block" width="20" height="20" fill="#730394" viewBox="0 0 17 17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="false"><title>Enthalten</title><path clip-rule="evenodd" d="m14.3838 3.3276c.3164.26739.3561.7406.0887 1.05695l-7.77602 9.20005c-.15078.1783-.37607.2763-.60937.2649s-.44798-.1308-.58067-.323l-3